{"id":"637432","name":"凉拌肥牛卷","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/637432/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"肥牛卷","amount":"500克"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"米椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"大蒜头","amount":"适量"},{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"一根"}],"sub":[{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好食材。","img":"images/637432/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"黄瓜去皮，切成丝。","img":"images/637432/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"香菜、大蒜头、米椒都切好。","img":"images/637432/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"黄瓜丝垫入碗底。","img":"images/637432/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"起锅烧水，加入料酒。","img":"images/637432/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"水开后，下入肥牛卷。","img":"images/637432/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"焯水3分钟，稍煮一下。","img":"images/637432/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"捞出，过凉水，清洗干净浮沫，放入大碗中。","img":"images/637432/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入香菜碎、米椒、大蒜头。","img":"images/637432/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加盐、糖、鸡精、蚝油、生抽、老抽、香油，香醋。","img":"images/637432/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"翻拌均匀。","img":"images/637432/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/637432/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放入垫有黄瓜丝的碗中。","img":"images/637432/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/637432/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/637432/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/637432/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/637432/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}